  "description": "Test build of Camille's Hookshot that hooks walls and towers (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Camille so her E hooks a wall, the map's edge or a tower in range near an enemy champion (aimed at where he will be), is pulled to it, clings and dives at him; a passive casts E whenever it is ready. No wall or tower nearby, no cast. Her R arena keeps its target in and its floor is drawn only while the arena lasts. Writes a log for testing.",
